! ---- CHECKS, read by tests/verify_mcp_page.py 104 ----------------
! Twenty-three symbols and NO rows: a SYN deposits no storage word,
! so there is nothing for a !CHECK to look at and none is written.
! The trailing "+" the page prints after every location is the SIGN,
! printed as a suffix the way printed p.84's negative SYN prints
! "000001.00-".  It is dropped here because listing_oracle.loc_bits
! parses a location as "word.bit" and has no sign field, and because
! every landed deck records the bare NNNNNN.NN -- p.99's convention.
!SYM   DRD      000001.00
!SYM   DRDS     000001.01
!SYM   DW       000001.40
!SYM   DWS      000001.41
!SYM   DCCW     000002.00
!SYM   DREL     000002.40
!SYM   DLOC     000003.00
!SYM   DLOCS    000003.01
!SYM   DERGS    000005.01
!SYM   DSP      000005.40
!SYM   DBSP     000006.00
!SYM   DSPFL    000006.40
!SYM   DBSFL    000007.00
!SYM   DWEF     000007.40
!SYM   DREW     000010.00
!SYM   DUNLD    000010.40
!SYM   DRLFS    000011.01
!SYM   DRLNS    000011.41
!SYM   DKLN     000012.00
!SYM   DKLNS    000012.01
!SYM   DFREE    000012.40
!SYM   DWAIT    000013.40
!SYM   DCHEX    000014.00
